The pending Tailscale SSH authentication completed successfully on this continuation. OpenSSH IPv4 2222 independently executed the read-only evidence/Git checks. No new key was installed. No public probe or repeat packet capture was performed in this continuation. The complete post-correction test matrix has NOT passed because no correction was activated; historical health results must not be represented as fresh results.

Keep original network policy and SSH action=check. Do not retry Phase 5 until both families on 22/2222, prohibited users, public negative tests, provider-only 80/443/ICMP, Fail2ban 2222, monitoring, website/DNS, Exit Node, listeners and unchanged containers are validated. Phase 5 also requires a proven automatic rollback and fresh iPhone validation. Check-to-accept is a separate later transaction.

